description "Talz Native

Indigenous peoples with primitive weaponry. Fill your Resource bar with damage to unleash special moves.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 85% more knockback
-- 5% faster RoF
- Longspear (Saber)
-- Poisons on hit
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- 100% more special damage
-- 15% more knockback
-- 25% longer Staff style
-- 66% thicker
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 166% more damage
- Snowball (16) (Rock)
-- 5900% more damage
-- 900% larger splash
-- Primary fire only
- Longbow (T-21 3)
-- Staggers/freezes/poisons on hit
-- 35% faster RoF
-- 50% slower mag reload
-- Primary fire only

^5Powers:
- Tribal Rage (3) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Strength (1)
- Fury (3)
- Getup (2)
- Healing (2)
- Assemble (1)
- 70% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS3]"